  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 \u015E\xF6valyesi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nCesaretin, ge\xE7mi\u015Fte ilerlemeni sa\u011Flayan en b\xFCy\xFCk
    kataliz\xF6r olmu\u015F {{isim}}. \xD6n\xFCne \xE7\u0131k\u0131p seni durdurmak
    isteyenlere ya da aya\u011F\u0131na \xE7elme takma niyetinde olanlara asla ald\u0131rmadan,
    d\xF6rt nala ko\u015Fturmu\u015Fsun at\u0131n\u0131. Ufukta bir zorluk g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    zaman, yak\u0131n\u0131na ula\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 beklemeden sen \xFCzerine
    gitmi\u015Fsin. Her t\xFCrl\xFC s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131yla adeta cenk etmi\u015F,
    k\u0131l\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 korkular\u0131n\u0131n \xFCzerine sallam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Kart\u0131n, bu azim ve motivasyonla adeta bir devrim ba\u015Flatt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    i\u015Faret ediyor. Hayat\u0131n\u0131n yeni ve bir \xFCst evresine sava\u015Farak
    ve ba\u015Fararak girmi\u015Fsin."
